Each receiver simply decodes all messages in a MAC fashion. The achievable rates must be in the intersection of $\mathcal{C}_M(\{1,2,3\},1)$ and $\mathcal{C}_M(\{1,2,3\},2)$ and the statement of the theorem follows.
